px-Sussur_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Sussur_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Sussur_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Sussur_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sussur_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Sussur_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Sickle\" title=\"Sussur Sickle\">Sussur Sickle</a></span></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195536\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.160 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.169 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7166/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 83156/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 19608/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1063/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.053/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1839909/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  139.990      1 -total\n 92.07%  128.892      1 Template:WeaponPage\n 26.45%   37.023     88 Template:Trim\n 24.97%   34.953     20 Template:Icon_text\n 18.11%   25.357     12 Template:Icon_link\n 16.84%   23.568      5 Template:Item_icon\n 15.47%   21.658      3 Template:Cond\n 14.39%   20.149      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.18%   19.855      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.38%   18.725     31 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4406-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195536 and revision id 371639. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}